      why_en: "The direction is the whole point. Syn61 frees three codons and pays 1.6-fold; Syn57 frees seven and pays 4-fold. Every synonymous substitution risks disturbing mRNA structure, ribosome binding or translation speed, and the damage accumulates — which is the central tension of the field, since you want to free more codons to encode more ncAAs.",
      why_cn: "方向才是重点。 Syn61 腾出 3 个密码子，代价 1.6 倍； Syn57 腾出 7 个，代价 4 倍。每一次同义替换都可能扰动 mRNA 结构、核糖体结合或翻译速度，损伤会累加——这正是这个领域的中心矛盾：你想腾出更多密码子去编码更多 ncAA ，而腾得越多细胞越弱。"
