      why_en: "PLP is the cofactor of the amino acid racemases that produce the D-alanine and D-glutamate of bacterial peptidoglycan, and it is also the cofactor for the decarboxylations that convert tyrosine, glutamate, tryptophan, histidine and ornithine into catecholamines, GABA, serotonin, histamine and the polyamines. Ferrochelatase, biliverdin reductase, NO synthase and glutathione peroxidase all use different cofactors — heme, none, a four-cofactor set, and selenocysteine respectively.",
      why_cn: "PLP 既是产生细菌肽聚糖所需 D-丙氨酸和 D-谷氨酸的氨基酸消旋酶的辅因子，也是把酪氨酸、谷氨酸、色氨酸、组氨酸和鸟氨酸分别转化为儿茶酚胺、 GABA 、血清素、组胺和多胺的那些脱羧反应的辅因子。亚铁螯合酶、胆绿素还原酶、一氧化氮合酶和谷胱甘肽过氧化物酶用的都是别的辅因子——分别是血红素、无、一组四种辅因子，以及硒代半胱氨酸。"
