      q_en: "The genetic code has 61 sense codons. According to the wobble hypothesis, what is the minimum number of tRNAs needed to translate all of them, and what physiological benefit does the loose third-base pairing provide?",
      q_cn: "遗传密码有 61 个有义密码子。按 wobble 假说，翻译它们全部最少需要多少种 tRNA ？而第三位的松散配对又带来什么生理上的好处？",
